    "id": 618,
    "chapter": 8,
    "chapterTitle": "Obstetric Physiology and Anesthesia",
    "stem": "A 5-kg, 3-month-old male infant undergoes a left inguinal herniorrhaphy with a spinal anesthetic. Typically, how long would 1 mL of a 0.5% bupivacaine (5 mg) isobaric solution last?",
